      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\nSelect pdfRest and OpenAI credentials, open the Form URL, upload a PDF, and ask a question. The required OpenAI Chat Model is connected beneath the Agent.\n\nTo make this conversational, replace the Form Trigger with a Chat Trigger that supports file uploads in your n8n deployment and keep the `data` binary field name.",
